(1684, 1, '2026-04-09 22:47:16', '2026-04-09 22:47:16', 'About the Product\r\n\r\nOur T-shirts are lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut elit tellus, luctus nec ullamcorper mattis, pulvinar dapibus leo.\r\n\r\n100% cotton\r\n260 g/m²\r\nBreathable fabric\r\nSize and fit\r\nThe model is wearing a size M and is 185 cm tall\r\nRegular fit for a relaxed, comfortable feel\r\nFree shipping and returns\r\n\r\nFree standard shipping on orders over $60.\r\n\r\nYou can return your order for any reason, free of charge, within 30 days\r\nWe also provide a free return shipping label\r\nT-shirt Name 1', 'T-shirt Name 1', 'Our T-shirts are lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut elit tellus, luctus nec ullamcorper mattis, pulvinar dapibus leo.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 't-shirt-name-1-3', '', '', '2026-04-10 10:25:06', '2026-04-10 10:25:06', '', 0, 'https://shop.kvadradoc.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=1684', 0, 'product', '', 0),
